 "<h3 class=\"fam-s\">Как идёт</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">💛 Любит: {0}<br>🧗 Даётся трудно: {1}<br>⏸ Где зависает: {2}</p>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Самый трудный шаг тропы ставится между двумя лёгкими и делается короче. Все шаги остаются.</p>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgOrd\"><input id=\"dgOrd\" type=\"checkbox\" {3}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Умный порядок</b><small>трудное между лёгким («сэндвич»)</small></span></label>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgBookIn\"><input id=\"dgBookIn\" type=\"checkbox\" {4}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Книжка — часть цели дня</b><small>день пройден, когда тропа и книжка</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Уже сделано утром</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"dgLife\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">🔥 На этой неделе {6} из {7} дней · недель подряд: {8}. Пропуск ничего не сжигает.</p>": [
  "<h3 class=\"fam-s\">How it is going</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">💛 Loves: {0}<br>🧗 Finds hard: {1}<br>⏸ Gets stuck: {2}</p>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">The hardest step of the path goes between two easy ones and is made shorter. All the steps stay.</p>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgOrd\"><input id=\"dgOrd\" type=\"checkbox\" {3}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Smart order</b><small>the hard one between easy ones («sandwich»)</small></span></label>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgBookIn\"><input id=\"dgBookIn\" type=\"checkbox\" {4}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>The book is part of the goal of the day</b><small>the day is done when the path and the book are done</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Already done this morning</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"dgLife\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">🔥 This week: {6} of {7} days · weeks in a row: {8}. A missed day burns nothing.</p>",
  "<h3 class=\"fam-s\">Como vai</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">💛 Gosta de: {0}<br>🧗 Acha difícil: {1}<br>⏸ Onde fica parado: {2}</p>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">O passo mais difícil do trilho fica entre dois fáceis e fica mais curto. Todos os passos ficam.</p>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgOrd\"><input id=\"dgOrd\" type=\"checkbox\" {3}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Ordem inteligente</b><small>o difícil entre os fáceis («sanduíche»)</small></span></label>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgBookIn\"><input id=\"dgBookIn\" type=\"checkbox\" {4}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>O livro faz parte do objetivo do dia</b><small>o dia está cumprido quando o trilho e o livro estiverem feitos</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Já feito de manhã</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"dgLife\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">🔥 Nesta semana: {6} de {7} dias · semanas seguidas: {8}. Faltar um dia não queima nada.</p>",
  "<h3 class=\"fam-s\">Wie es läuft</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">💛 Mag: {0}<br>🧗 Fällt schwer: {1}<br>⏸ Wo es hängt: {2}</p>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Der schwerste Schritt des Pfads kommt zwischen zwei leichte und wird kürzer. Alle Schritte bleiben.</p>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgOrd\"><input id=\"dgOrd\" type=\"checkbox\" {3}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Kluge Reihenfolge</b><small>das Schwere zwischen Leichtem («Sandwich»)</small></span></label>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"dgBookIn\"><input id=\"dgBookIn\" type=\"checkbox\" {4}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Das Buch gehört zum Tagesziel</b><small>der Tag ist geschafft, wenn Pfad und Buch fertig sind</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Schon am Morgen gemacht</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"dgLife\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">🔥 Diese Woche: {6} von {7} Tagen · Wochen in Folge: {8}. Ein verpasster Tag verbrennt nichts.</p>"
